{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-11-18 08:00:00', 'title': 'ORACLE EXPLORES THE FUTURE OF ENERGY AT NEW SMITHSONIAN FUTURES EXHIBIT', 'text': 'WASHINGTON AND AUSTIN, TEXAS, NOV. 18, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- A NEW VIRTUAL REALITY (VR) EXPERIENCE DESIGNED TO EXPLORE A CLEAN ENERGY FUTURE WILL BE UNVEILED AT THE SMITHSONIAN\'S GROUNDBREAKING NEW EXPERIENCE "FUTURES"\xa0OPENING SATURDAY, NOVEMBER 20TH AT THE HISTORIC ARTS AND INDUSTRIES BUILDING (AIB). CREATED BY ORACLE IN COLLABORATION WITH CURATORS, \'FUTURE OF ENERGY,\' AIMS TO HELP VISITORS BETTER UNDERSTAND HOW THEY USE ENERGY, WAYS TO CONSERVE IT, AND THEIR ROLE IN BUILDING A CLEAN ENERGY FUTURE.'}